","book_id":"b-shiji-097","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-097-luli"}],"table_passages":[{"id":"shiji-020-t2-r004-c01","column":1,"rowspan":1,"colspan":1,"text":"田千秋，家在長陵。以故高廟寢郎上書諫孝武曰：「子弄父兵，罪當笞。父子之怒，自古有之。蚩尤畔父，黃帝涉江」。上書至意，拜為大鴻臚。征和四年為丞相，封三千戶。至昭帝時病死，子順代立，為虎牙將軍，擊匈奴，不至質，誅死，國除。","source_row":4,"source_column":2,"printed_page":null,"person_mentions":[{"id":"shiji-020-t2-r004-c01-m000","start":42,"end":44,"surface":"蚩尤","person_id":"7x2_x55_1b6","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"依本格國別、事件與本篇時間範圍核讀的完整名字暫定同指；非全域字串配對，省稱與世襲稱號另行核讀。"}],"table_id":"shiji-020","table_fragment_id":"shiji-020-digital-table-2","table_row_id":"shiji-020-t2-r004","table_cell_id":"shiji-020-t2-r004-c01","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-020","chapter_id":"table-chapter-shiji-020","source_id":"table-witness-shiji-020","source_revision":"2607036","source_header":["",""],"row_year":null}],"sources":[{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-001-wudi","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-001","source_id":"s-shiji-001-wudi","source":{"title":"史記／卷001","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷001","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷001&oldid=7903634","revision_id":7903634,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"正文全文；不含現代章節標題、跨維基說明與校勘記","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫 CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及版本連結。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","normalization":{"character_conversion":{"弃":"棄","异":"異"},"note":"保留古代異體；移除現代註號，兩個簡體字形明記轉換。"}}},{"chapter_id":"c-shiji-003-yin","work_id":"w-shiji","book_id":"b-shiji-003","source_id":"s-shiji-003-yin","source":{"title":"史記／卷003","provider":"維基文庫","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/史記/卷003","permalink":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?title=史記/卷003&oldid=7909145","revision_id":7909145,"accessed_on":"2026-10-09","extent":"正文全文；不含現代章節標題與註號。","image_verified":false,"rights":"古代原文；數位轉錄依維基文庫 CC BY-SA 4.0，保留署名及固定版本。","license_url":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","no